      { q: "Why does the writer mention their mother?", qjp: "ひっしゃは どうして ははの ことを かきましたか。", answer: "As an example of station staff helping someone", options: ["To show that the elderly use trains less","As an example of station staff helping someone","To complain about a railway company","To explain why tickets are expensive"] },
      { q: "What does the writer propose?", qjp: "ひっしゃは どう するべきだと いって いますか。", answer: "Have staff at least in the morning and evening", options: ["Keep staff at all stations all day","Replace staff with better machines","Have staff at least in the morning and evening","Close stations with few users"] }
