      { q: "How did the 1,000 yen problem end?", qjp: "1,000えんの もんだいは どう おわりましたか。", answer: "The customer came back and returned it", options: ["The manager paid it","Karan paid it himself","The money was found under the till","The customer came back and returned it"] }
